# OT_RCK_BAND_INST through BUF/INV/HB only is placed FIRM on the first OT_RCK_BAND_ROWS legal rows (2 rows clear) below
# the PHY supply region (OT_RCK_BAND_TOP_UM = the region's lower edge), at the x of its macro pin, so the macro-to-capture
